- AllAuthorized: The full authorization scope, subject to the application address book authorization limits.
- SelectedDepartments: The selected departments and all their sub-departments.
When explicitly submitting syncScope, you must provide a valid mode, which is validated by the backend.', example='SelectedDepartments'),
    }(name='syncScope', description='Follows the synchronization scope definition by department. If omitted during creation, the default value is AllAuthorized. The first vendor synchronization is determined by syncOnBind. If omitted or set to null during an update, the original value is retained. Updating and saving the scope does not automatically perform full synchronization.'),
  }(name='body', description='The request content for updating the external identity provider.'),
}

